  "description": "<p>WebAC is now part of the API specification, and should not be an add-on module.  Move it into the fcrepo4 repository<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-module-auth-webac\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo-module-auth-webac</a></p>\n\n<p>Apparently, fcrepo-module-auth-webac depends on some classes from rbacl, which is in fcrepo4-exts.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-module-auth-rbacl\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-module-auth-rbacl</a></p>\n\n<p>Move all necessary code from those external repositories into the core code base.</p>",
